# The Step Pyramid's robbers' way (CIPlay step_pyramid_spikes, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in
# the recipe: the robbers' way from its mouth at 22 -36 west to 12 -36; the stakes (spspike, 3x2) at 15.8..17 -36.8..-35.2,
# the hazard zone sp_spikes at 16.4 -36 (r 2, pulse 2 s up / 3 s down, safe=none); the carving spspikewarn at 20.5 -34.8;
# the priests' lever splever at 11.5 -37.2 (reached from the hall by the tomb door). Floors ~2.5 m (a guess).
# Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island The Step Pyramid keep
offset -1.8093 10.1439
hour 11
weather Calm

expect shown spspikes
expect shown spspike

# In by the robbers' way: onto the stakes - hurt and the message; back out - no more harm
walk 26 -36 to 22 -36 to 19 -36 to 16.4 -36
wait 7
expect message priests' trap
expect hurt 4
picture sp_spikes 20 +2 -36 16.4 +0 -36 light=20
walk 16.4 -36 to 19 -36 to 22 -36
wait 3
expect unhurt

# Round by the tomb door to the hall, the lever: the stakes stay down; then the robbers' way is safe
walk 22 -36 to 25 -41 to 22 -46 to 8 -46 to 8 -38 to 10.5 -37.2
use splever
expect hidden spspikes
expect hidden spspike
walk 10.5 -37.2 to 12 -36 to 16.4 -36 to 19 -36
wait 5
expect unhurt
walk 19 -36 to 22 -36 to 26 -36
